Subject: [PATCH 425/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0424: scope
 Enter and Esc, send after the take settles, light-safe colours, approval row

Enter and Esc act only from the composer or the page, never while the chat is busy or a menu, dialog or overlay is open. Send now stops the take first, sends the settled draft once, and lets Enter fall through when it cannot send. The sheet gets light and dark safe state colours, the desktop bar moves the approval buttons to their own row when narrow, and the disabled Stop stays visible.
